  description: 'Infernal Tiefling blessed with the elemental magic from birth. Abandoned
    as a child by his parents because of his status as a sorcerer, who were hunted
    by an underground organization known as the "Equalizers". To survive he joined
    a criminal circle that helped keep him safe and teach him how to survive. Using
    this arcane power came natural to him, so much that he started experimenting
    with different ways of utilizing them to his advantage. '
